oh-my-pi (Step Runtime)
----------------------
This repository vendors [oh-my-pi](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi) as a
Git submodule at `omp-patch/vendor/oh-my-pi`, pinned in `omp-patch/upstream.json`.
It is a legacy layer: the live runtime is Step Code's `step` CLI, driven over
JSONL stdio by the Rust adapter in `crates/step-studio-runtime`. The overlay and
seam patches remain for that vendored tree.

